{"Data_Dictionary":[{"Metric Name":"Total Foreign Citizenss in Germany","Definition":"Grand total of all non-German Citizenss legally registered in Germany as of 31 Dec each year via AZR register.","Source Name":"Destatis","Source Type":"German Federal Statistics Office (Official)","Direct URL":"https://www.destatis.de/EN/Themes/Society-Environment/Population/Migration-Integration/Tables/foreigner-citizenship-time-serie.html","Filters Applied":"Citizenship: All; Reference date: 31 Dec","Known Limitation":"Stock data only. Includes all purposes — work, study, family, humanitarian."},{"Metric Name":"Indian Citizenss in Germany (All Purposes)","Definition":"Total Indian citizens registered in Germany regardless of residence purpose.","Source Name":"Destatis","Source Type":"German Federal Statistics Office (Official)","Direct URL":"https://www.destatis.de/EN/Themes/Society-Environment/Population/Migration-Integration/Tables/foreigner-citizenship-time-serie.html","Filters Applied":"Citizenship: India; Reference date: 31 Dec","Known Limitation":"Not filtered by employment. Includes students, dependents, humanitarian cases."},{"Metric Name":"Indian Employment Permits (Eurostat)","Definition":"Count of Indian Citizenss holding a valid residence permit in Germany issued specifically for employment reasons as of 31 Dec each year.","Source Name":"Eurostat","Source Type":"EU Official Statistics (data sourced from German AZR)","Direct URL":"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/bookmark/2287cf4e-ece0-45d7-a365-ee4497614f1e?lang=en&createdAt=2026-06-03T08:22:54Z","Filters Applied":"Citizenship: India; Reason: Employment; Duration: Total; Geo: Germany","Known Limitation":"2025 data unavailable at time of access."},{"Metric Name":"South & SE Asia Employment Permits (GENESIS)","Definition":"Foreigners from South and South East Asia holding temporary employment residence permits in Germany.","Source Name":"Destatis GENESIS","Source Type":"German Federal Statistics Office (Official)","Direct URL":"https://genesis.destatis.de/datenbank/online/url/cb707a2b","Filters Applied":"Region: South & SE Asia; Permit: Temporary Employment; Ref date: 31 Dec","Known Limitation":"Cannot filter by individual country. India included in regional grouping alongside Pakistan, Bangladesh, Sri Lanka, others."},{"Metric Name":"Annual Migration Flows — Germany","Definition":"Annual arrivals and departures of foreign Citizenss and Indian citizens across Germany's borders.","Source Name":"Destatis","Source Type":"German Federal Statistics Office (Official)","Direct URL":"https://www.destatis.de/EN/Themes/Society-Environment/Population/Migration/Tables/migration-year-02.html","Filters Applied":"Citizenship: Total Citizens(including Germany) + Germans + Total Foreign + India ","Known Limitation":"Flow data — counts movements in a year, not total resident population. Not filtered by purpose of migration."},{"Metric Name":"Annual Migration Flows — Germany","Definition":"Monthly arrivals and departures of foreign Citizenss and Indian citizens across Germany's borders.","Source Name":"Destatis","Source Type":"German Federal Statistics Office (Official)","Direct URL":"https://www.destatis.de/EN/Themes/Society-Environment/Population/Migration/Tables/migration-month-02.html","Filters Applied":"Citizenship: Total Citizens(including Germany) + Germans + Total Foreign + India ","Known Limitation":"Flow data — counts movements over months, not total resident population. Not filtered by purpose of migration."},{"Metric Name":"Germany-India Geographic Migration","Definition":"Annual migration flows (Arrivals, Departures, and Net Migration Balance) recorded directly between the physical borders of Germany and India. A small fraction of \"Foreigners\" on this route may hold non-Indian passports.","Source Name":"Destatis GENESIS","Source Type":"German Federal Statistical Office (Official)","Direct URL":"https://genesis.destatis.de/datenbank/online/url/f72b8447","Filters Applied":"Orig